    (property "Note" "ON THE 5 V RAIL, and that is the point: TTL thresholds mean a 3.3 V input reads high, and the output is ~4.4 V minimum into a WS2815 that wants 3.15-3.85 V. Gates B, C and D are spare (ADR 0016: one strip) - the head of the strip grounds its BI rather than being driven" (at 40.64 50.8 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) hide))
